  "job_B20.20.1_20251003_114511": {
    "chunk_text": "\ufffdtyw\u00f0 Butan \u00feissum \u00feingum \u00fee we sprecende synt, synt geswutelunga & gehwylcnyssa, & twelf winda Lengtentima & cildiugo\u00f0 ge\u00few\u00e6rl\u00e6ca\u00f0; & cnihtiugo\u00f0 & sumor beo\u00f0 gelice; & h\u00e6rfest & ge\u00feungen Lengtentima ys w\u00e6t & wearm; \u00fe\u00e6t lyft ys w\u00e6t & wearm; cildyld by\u00f0 w\u00e6t & wearm, & hyra blod by\u00f0 \u00e6stas ys sumor; he by\u00f0 wearm & drigge. Fyr by\u00f0 wearm & drigge; cnihtiugo\u00f0 by\u00f0 wearm & drigge. Colera rubea, \u00fe\u00e6t synt reade inco\u00f0a, beo\u00f0 on sumera; hig beo\u00f0 wearme & drigge. Autumnus, \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 h\u00e6rfest; his gecynd ys \u00fe\u00e6t he beo ceald & drigge. Eor\u00f0e ys ceald & drigge: ge\u00feungen yld by\u00f0 drigge & ceald. On h\u00e6rfeste beo\u00f0 colera nigra, \u00fe\u00e6t synt swearte inco\u00f0an; \u00fea beo\u00f0 drige & cealde. Hiemps ys winter; he by\u00f0 ceald & w\u00e6t; w\u00e6ter ys ceald & w\u00e6t; swa by\u00f0 se ealda man ceald & Flegmata, \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00f0 hraca o\u00f0\u00f0e geposu, deria\u00f0 \u00feam ealdan & \u00feam unhalan. We \u00e6thrynon mid urum arun \u00fea y\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6s deopan w\u00e6lis: we gesawon eac \u00fea muntas ymbe \u00fe\u00e6re \u00dea y\u00f0an getacnia\u00f0 \u00feisne deopan cr\u00e6ft, & \u00fea muntas getacnia\u00f0 eac \u00fea mycelnyssa \u00feises cr\u00e6ftes. Hyt cwy\u00f0 for\u00f0on, \u00fe\u00e6r we gesawon \u00fe\u00e6re lilian blosman, \u00fe",
